{"id":"steam-3456950","steam":3456950,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Pixel Gun 2","summary":"Fast-paced multiplayer shooter with destructible arenas, wild builds, and matches that never play the same. Break the map, adapt on the fly, and outplay your opponents in short, chaotic PvP battles.","about":"From the creators of Pixel Gun 3D (300M+ players) comes a rule-breaking and reality-bending sequel. Gear up, join the fray, and outsmart your opponents in chaotic shootouts where no two matches play out the same.\n\nPIXEL GUN 2 IS ALL ABOUT:\n\n• \nFast-paced PvP shooting action\n• \nFully destructible maps\n• \nBuild-driven gameplay and limitless loadout options\n• \nSeamless cross-platform progression (PC + Mobile)\n• \nWinning your way\n\nKEY FEATURES\n\nEvery match hits different\n\nChange is the only constant in Pixel Gun 2. The destructible map is reshaped with every shot fired, players clash with unique builds and playstyles, and you evolve during the match by stacking passive perks on the go.\n\nNext match? Different builds. Different mayhem. Different outcomes.\n\nAnd that’s exactly the point.\n\nWreak havoc. Make a mess\n\nPixel Gun 2 maps are built to be destroyed — and creative ruination is a core part of the gameplay.\n\nWalls won’t protect you for long. High ground doesn’t stay safe. Camping spots disappear along with the concrete they’re standing on. Use the environment to your advantage: create new paths, flush enemies out of cover, and deal with the consequences of your “architectural adjustments.”\n\nYou’re not here to preserve the map. You’re here to reshape it.\n\nYour character. Your build. Your playstyle\n\nPixel Gun 2 is all about freedom of expression through gameplay.\n\nChoose from a roster of characters, then build around them using weapons, gadgets, armor, and a deck of perks. Enhance what matters most to your setup, create powerful, tactical, or outright weird synergies, experiment with loadouts, and find combinations that work best for you — and against your opponents.\n\nThere’s no single “right” build. The meta is meant to be questioned — and broken.\n\nCross-platform multiplayer & shared progression\n\nPlay on PC or mobile — whenever and however you like.\n\nPixel Gun 2 supports cross-platform multiplayer and shared account progression. Your unlocks, rewards, and progress carry across devices with no friction. Quick sessions on mobile. Longer, more focused and competitive play on PC.\r\nOne account. One progression path. Same content.\n\nThe Pixelstorm is rising\n\nPixel Gun 2 is a live-service game built to evolve over time.\n\nA strange phenomenon known as the Pixelstorm keeps bending the rules of reality, reshaping the world and opening new possibilities — and new dangers.\n\nExpect regular updates with:\n\n• \nnew characters and gear\n• \nnew abilities and build options\n• \nnew maps, modes, and seasonal content\n\nThe game grows alongside its community, constantly introducing new ways to play.\n\nJump in. Break the arena. Play solo or team up with friends. Adapt, experiment, and see what happens.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/ca363bb790154107649923f8db5af17771b0b08a/library_capsule.jpg?t=1793898976","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/e52e0cc9c67e43afa9b6a0b98ba64fb241cda279/header.jpg?t=1793898976","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/ee0f60e13cbd8b727df8f151719e1bb3a6e3e98d/library_hero.jpg?t=1793898976","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/e52e0cc9c67e43afa9b6a0b98ba64fb241cda279/header.jpg?t=1793898976","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456950/9cfa60422aa36a7651da918084060d950c6a3087/ss_9cfa60422aa36a7651da918084060d950c6a3087.600x338.jpg?t=1793898976","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite